WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.250
- Welcome back to Trump Watch.

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.850
And in this latest episode
of a thing I just invented

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:07.340
we are looking at the
investigation of Cy Vance,

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:10.050
the prosecutor in
Manhattan, who is looking

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:12.740
into the Trump Organization
and the Trump finances.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.820
And, according to reports,
Vance is talking to a lot

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:16.630
of different people,
not only Michael Cohen,

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:18.790
who Southern district of
New York federal prosecutors

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:20.900
have talked to seven or eight times now,

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:24.510
but also the ex daughter-in-law
of Allen Weisselberg,

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:26.160
the CFO of the Trump Organization.

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:27.280
And according to The New York Times,

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:29.410
Cy Vance has subpoenaed
the personal bank records

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:31.910
of Weisselberg himself
and are scrutinizing gifts

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:33.870
he received from former President Trump.

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:35.361
Now, of course, this may
never amount to anything

00:00:35.361 --> 00:00:36.810
but that has a lot of interviews,

00:00:36.810 --> 00:00:38.850
that is a lot of effort being spent

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:40.720
if there's no there, there.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.870
So, it's entirely possible
that we will see members

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:44.350
of the Trump Organization in court.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:47.053
Just like, I'll see you in
court, if you don't subscribe.

